{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42fa82d48c79d592f351f69284404b208cb54702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-2$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> is divided by the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a201fddef752223c4dadd1238207df8ca4ef4d8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />, the remainder is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed2db4a3257045e63a4c61de4b0cba2f5ce51025.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ 2 \\qquad  \\text{(B)} \\ -2 \\qquad  \\text{(C)} \\ -2x-2 \\qquad  \\text{(D)} \\ 2x+2 \\qquad  \\text{(E)} \\ 2x-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"499\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Working out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/e/8ae6374b3aafce2c4cbc115487c65b5a74675e4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^3-2}{x^2-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"51\" height=\"39\" /> using polynomial long division, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2aba7f7b1b542d316f365d448a2805e4b712b48c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\frac{2x-2}{x^2-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"89\" height=\"40\" />. \nThus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a6388ed47d2b9ad0da98289ac7f65fe023b9c67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x -2$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, for choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af0cd82367e63fe9f487758f5656e94818f4d4b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting an easy value, like <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d21c2ec86f795e8e0730842421df93d252c902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, with a remainder of 4. Then you just plug in x to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>-dragoon\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/inde